META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-611025-pwq-minclass-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-611025: RHEL 9 must not allow blank or null passwords.`
    description `RHEL 9 must not allow blank or null passwords.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-611025,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-611025.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the content of /etc/security/pwquality.conf for the required configuration setting.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target_file
        path `/etc/security/pwquality.conf`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE content_check
        content string contains `minclass`
